WEBVTT

00:01.137 --> 00:03.717
I need you in my party, got it?

00:03.797 --> 00:04.967
[gasps]

00:05.057 --> 00:07.097
I hope you'll keep
lending me your strength.

00:07.177 --> 00:08.347
♪

00:10.187 --> 00:11.187
[grunts]

00:14.727 --> 00:16.687
[panting]

00:19.947 --> 00:22.197
Dice Thrust!

00:22.277 --> 00:23.777
[grunts]

00:24.367 --> 00:25.407
[gasps]

00:25.487 --> 00:28.657
[Ruche yells]

00:28.747 --> 00:30.617
[straining]

00:36.997 --> 00:38.377
[squeals excitedly]

00:38.457 --> 00:40.127
[gasps, chuckles]

00:40.217 --> 00:42.177
-[Ruche grunts]
-[AUTOMATED VOICE] Critical.

00:45.137 --> 00:46.007
[Ruche grunts]

00:47.637 --> 00:49.137
♪

00:51.187 --> 00:52.517
[grunts]

00:53.687 --> 00:54.857
[Golden Raana croaks]

00:54.937 --> 00:56.067
[thuds]

00:58.937 --> 01:00.817
[clinking]

01:00.897 --> 01:02.157
[ELYMAS] It's nice that
Golden Raana

01:02.237 --> 01:03.567
-are worth a lot of EXP.
-[Ruche gasps]

01:03.657 --> 01:05.237
But the best part

01:05.317 --> 01:07.577
is the valuable items
they can drop.

01:08.407 --> 01:10.907
The drop rate is right at 50%.

01:10.997 --> 01:12.117
[gasps]

01:23.507 --> 01:24.547
[gasps]

01:25.217 --> 01:26.307
[gasps]

01:30.097 --> 01:31.727
[squeals excitedly]

01:31.807 --> 01:33.267
[chuckles excitedly]

01:34.017 --> 01:36.017
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade.

01:36.107 --> 01:37.727
Attack, plus 12.

01:37.817 --> 01:40.477
Market price, 17 million gold.

01:40.567 --> 01:42.607
A glittering Raana short sword.

01:42.697 --> 01:44.737
A hunk
of high-purity Raana gold.

01:44.817 --> 01:45.907
[squeals excitedly]

01:45.987 --> 01:48.577
A Dazzling Raana
Decorative Blade!

01:50.077 --> 01:52.907
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:24.547 --> 03:27.007
Wow. I can't believe
how easily we acquired

03:27.087 --> 03:29.757
a 1,700,000 gold item!

03:31.507 --> 03:32.557
[ELYMAS] Hold on.

03:32.637 --> 03:34.217
You're actually missing a digit.

03:34.307 --> 03:35.427
Add a zero to that.

03:35.517 --> 03:36.637
Huh?

03:36.727 --> 03:38.887
The item's worth 17 million.

03:38.977 --> 03:40.647
Uh...

03:41.307 --> 03:42.937
[Ruche chuckles nervously]

03:46.527 --> 03:50.357
One, two, three, four.

03:50.447 --> 03:54.487
Wait. You're right. That's 17.

03:54.577 --> 03:56.827
[whimpering weakly]

03:58.207 --> 04:00.377
[stifled gasp]

04:01.287 --> 04:03.087
[RUCHE] My old party
ended up kicking me

04:03.167 --> 04:06.007
because I wanted my share
of that Blood-Soaked Sword.

04:06.087 --> 04:08.257
And it was
only worth two million.

04:08.967 --> 04:10.637
Have you calmed down
a little bit?

04:10.717 --> 04:12.757
Yeah, I think so.

04:12.847 --> 04:16.177
Um. That said,
it was pretty shocking.

04:16.267 --> 04:20.017
Look at how simple it was for us
to obtain something so valuable.

04:20.097 --> 04:22.767
Maybe that's odd for me
to say after you set this up,

04:22.857 --> 04:24.977
but I still don't understand
how we did it.

04:26.607 --> 04:27.687
[gasps]

04:28.857 --> 04:30.607
Wait! Carrying around
something rare like this

04:30.697 --> 04:32.817
is going to
make us huge targets!

04:32.907 --> 04:35.527
Come on!
Let's run away together!

04:35.617 --> 04:37.197
We'll hide out
in some remote place

04:37.287 --> 04:38.287
where we won't be found!

04:38.577 --> 04:41.247
Yes, that's what we should do.
Yup, yup, yup.

04:41.327 --> 04:43.127
-[Elymas chuckles softly]
-[Ruche whimpering]

04:43.207 --> 04:44.247
Well.

04:44.337 --> 04:45.667
You're not wrong.

04:47.757 --> 04:49.297
We need to get going.

04:51.217 --> 04:53.757
Before the sun goes down,
we'll farm one more.

04:55.007 --> 04:57.517
What? You're kidding, right?

04:57.597 --> 04:58.557
[chuckles softly]

05:07.187 --> 05:08.897
[ELYMAS] Three hours later.

05:09.647 --> 05:11.737
-And Dice Thrust!
-[AUTOMATED VOICE] Miss.

05:11.817 --> 05:13.987
-Let's go, Dice Thrust!
-[AUTOMATED VOICE] Miss.

05:14.067 --> 05:16.367
-Dice Thrust time!
-[AUTOMATED VOICE] Miss.

05:16.447 --> 05:18.287
-How 'bout now?
-[AUTOMATED VOICE] Miss.

05:18.367 --> 05:19.787
Just work already!

05:19.867 --> 05:20.747
[AUTOMATED VOICE] Miss.

05:21.707 --> 05:23.747
This is it! Now Dice Thrust!

05:25.497 --> 05:26.797
♪

05:26.877 --> 05:28.167
[Ruche grunts]

05:29.047 --> 05:30.167
[AUTOMATED VOICE] Critical.

05:38.717 --> 05:40.677
Well done! That's two!

05:41.347 --> 05:43.477
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Level 33 has been reached.

05:43.557 --> 05:45.897
-[Ruche whimpering]
-[ELYMAS] Ruche?

05:45.977 --> 05:47.517
-Uh.
-[Ruche sobbing]

05:47.607 --> 05:50.317
[crying]

05:51.147 --> 05:53.777
Uh, hey. Come on. No big deal.

05:53.857 --> 05:55.407
So maybe you missed a few times.

05:55.487 --> 05:57.777
That just means you're saving
your luck for later.

05:57.867 --> 05:59.367
♪

06:00.827 --> 06:01.787
[RUCHE] 30--

06:01.867 --> 06:03.287
[chuckles]

06:03.907 --> 06:07.037
Thirty-four million.

06:09.797 --> 06:12.127
-[chuckles in disbelief]
-[Elymas gasps]

06:12.207 --> 06:13.467
Uh, Ruche?

06:13.547 --> 06:16.427
Pull yourself together!
It's all right!

06:16.507 --> 06:17.427
Ruche!

06:20.597 --> 06:23.017
[Ruche laughing incredulously]

06:23.097 --> 06:24.187
♪

06:24.767 --> 06:26.307
It's just so much.

06:27.477 --> 06:30.227
These are worth millions
upon millions of gold.

06:31.227 --> 06:32.897
Thanks to your skills,

06:32.987 --> 06:36.197
we've gathered two Dazzling
Raana Decorative Blades.

06:36.277 --> 06:37.567
And soon we'll need to determine

06:37.657 --> 06:39.777
the most effective use
of this money.

06:39.867 --> 06:41.367
For our party's sake,

06:41.447 --> 06:44.197
we need to start planning
and choose well.

06:44.287 --> 06:46.167
[RUCHE] Right. I agree.

06:46.247 --> 06:48.707
We have to start thinking more
about our future.

06:49.337 --> 06:51.877
But none of this
feels real to me.

06:51.957 --> 06:53.167
It's weird.

06:54.167 --> 06:55.877
[ELYMAS] We should consider
our current equipment

06:55.967 --> 06:58.177
when deciding how
to spend our skill points.

06:58.257 --> 07:00.597
[RUCHE] Oh, yeah!
I've been leveling up a lot,

07:00.677 --> 07:02.427
so that means I still have
plenty of skill points

07:02.507 --> 07:03.927
I haven't even used yet.

07:04.017 --> 07:05.937
How should I spend them all?

07:06.637 --> 07:08.807
Mm. You really ought
to keep that private

07:08.897 --> 07:10.147
and not show other people.

07:10.767 --> 07:12.937
Ah, now don't you worry.

07:13.027 --> 07:16.197
I owe you! Nobody else
could've helped me come this far

07:16.277 --> 07:18.487
and gotten me
to such a high level!

07:18.567 --> 07:20.487
So you could even use me up.

07:20.567 --> 07:23.697
And then toss me aside,
and I still wouldn't mind.

07:23.787 --> 07:24.867
[chuckles nervously]
I'm pretty sure

07:25.247 --> 07:27.077
I'd feel even worse
if you didn't care at all.

07:28.287 --> 07:29.207
Mm?

07:30.127 --> 07:31.417
[gasps]

07:31.497 --> 07:32.457
Hey, what is it?

07:32.547 --> 07:34.547
[♪ foreboding music playing]

07:35.957 --> 07:37.377
[Ruche gasps]

07:41.347 --> 07:42.307
A voice.

07:44.307 --> 07:45.637
-Voice?
-Mm?

07:46.477 --> 07:49.097
Yes. It sounded like
a baby was crying

07:49.187 --> 07:50.857
way off in the distance.

07:51.557 --> 07:53.187
Uh! [gasps]

07:57.987 --> 07:59.277
A crying baby?

08:05.247 --> 08:06.117
[Elymas gasps]

08:06.867 --> 08:07.787
Could it be?

08:12.327 --> 08:14.497
-It's wandering now.
-[gasps]

08:18.297 --> 08:20.927
[ELYMAS] A dungeon's boss,
called its Dreamlord,

08:21.007 --> 08:22.087
is essentially its heart.

08:23.347 --> 08:25.887
Normally, it remains
deep within its walls.

08:25.967 --> 08:28.847
But sometimes, it ventures out

08:29.477 --> 08:31.687
and roams around
the other levels as well.

08:33.057 --> 08:35.477
It's known as wandering.

08:36.607 --> 08:38.187
So, it's just loose?!

08:38.277 --> 08:41.487
Isn't this Dreamlord meant
for adventurers at Level 50?!

08:41.567 --> 08:44.657
-That doesn't sound so good.
-We're fine.

08:45.277 --> 08:47.997
If we take the right steps,
I'm certain we can avoid it.

08:49.907 --> 08:51.997
We need to start
moving away from the voice

08:52.077 --> 08:53.377
and straight for the exit.

08:54.037 --> 08:56.587
The Dreamlord
won't follow us outside.

08:56.667 --> 08:58.507
Then it isn't gonna chase us?

08:58.587 --> 09:01.047
What a load off my mind.

09:01.127 --> 09:03.797
[ELYMAS] Yeah. There's really
nothing to it at all.

09:05.467 --> 09:07.257
We'll make our way out of here,

09:07.347 --> 09:10.057
then head back to town
and cash in our loot.

09:10.137 --> 09:12.897
At least that's where
this adventure of ours

09:12.977 --> 09:14.517
should have ended.

09:14.607 --> 09:15.687
But...

09:16.857 --> 09:18.487
Help us! Please!

09:18.567 --> 09:19.567
[gasps]

09:19.647 --> 09:20.737
[gasps]

09:20.817 --> 09:22.027
[both adventurers panting]

09:22.107 --> 09:23.777
[ELYMAS] I was just being naive.

09:24.907 --> 09:26.617
We were fighting a monster,

09:26.697 --> 09:28.787
and then a much more
powerful one showed up!

09:28.867 --> 09:31.247
It was too strong for us!

09:31.327 --> 09:33.577
[Ruche whimpering]

09:33.667 --> 09:35.587
[♪ dramatic music playing]

09:37.877 --> 09:39.587
[both panting]

09:41.627 --> 09:43.427
[ELYMAS] This isn't a game
we're playing.

09:43.507 --> 09:44.507
[MAN] Stay with me!

09:45.137 --> 09:47.047
[ELYMAS] Those two will never
get out of here like that.

09:47.137 --> 09:48.387
It just appeared.

09:48.467 --> 09:50.517
[ELYMAS] We can't leave
this dungeon now.

09:50.597 --> 09:53.187
If we try to escape,
they'll definitely die!

09:55.227 --> 09:56.227
[grunts]

10:04.067 --> 10:05.367
Listen!

10:05.447 --> 10:07.907
You need to take them both
outside right away!

10:08.777 --> 10:10.657
While I keep
the monster occupied!

10:10.747 --> 10:13.457
[RUCHE] Okay, but you realize
that not even someone

10:13.537 --> 10:17.247
as strong as you can handle
a Level 50 Dreamlord, right?!

10:17.337 --> 10:19.377
[ELYMAS] I understand
how it behaves,

10:19.457 --> 10:21.507
so I can buy some time
for you three

10:21.587 --> 10:23.217
and escape by myself.

10:23.297 --> 10:25.127
-Besides...
-Uh.

10:25.217 --> 10:26.427
[gasps]

10:27.097 --> 10:30.637
... as a Heavy Knight,
it's my job to draw aggro.

10:33.267 --> 10:34.387
Mr. Elymas.

10:35.017 --> 10:36.597
[grunts tensely]

10:39.057 --> 10:41.227
[♪ ominous music playing]

10:41.317 --> 10:42.857
[Ruche squeals in fright]

10:43.857 --> 10:46.237
[both whimpering]

10:58.877 --> 11:00.127
[ELYMAS] There you are.

11:04.967 --> 11:06.627
[footsteps approaching]

11:16.937 --> 11:17.897
[ELYMAS] Tin Knight.

11:20.647 --> 11:23.227
[both adventurers panting]

11:23.317 --> 11:24.687
Help us! Please!

11:24.777 --> 11:27.237
-[both gasp]
-We were fighting a monster,

11:27.317 --> 11:29.617
and then a much more
powerful one showed up!

11:30.327 --> 11:31.327
[woman coughs]

11:31.697 --> 11:33.237
[ELYMAS] This isn't a game
we're playing.

11:33.327 --> 11:36.207
[both panting]

11:36.287 --> 11:38.167
[♪ dramatic music playing]

11:46.087 --> 11:47.467
[Ruche squeals in fright]

11:47.547 --> 11:48.967
[both whimpering]

12:14.697 --> 12:16.497
I'll take it from here!

12:17.117 --> 12:19.327
Now go! Get them outside.

12:19.407 --> 12:20.957
Wait. Hang on.

12:21.037 --> 12:24.457
Sir, thank you.
Thank you for helping us.

12:24.537 --> 12:26.207
[gasps]

12:37.347 --> 12:38.427
Look at that.

12:38.517 --> 12:40.267
It's sustained some damage.

12:42.227 --> 12:44.227
The situation
could be a lot worse.

12:50.817 --> 12:51.987
[gasps]

12:52.067 --> 12:54.947
All right.
That creature may seem powerful,

12:55.027 --> 12:56.447
but it's been weakened.

12:56.537 --> 12:58.287
Let's defeat it together!

12:58.367 --> 13:00.617
-[ELYMAS] No. Not this time.
-[gasps]

13:00.707 --> 13:02.917
-You must run.
-[RUCHE] I wanna help!

13:02.997 --> 13:04.167
This is a Tin Knight,

13:04.247 --> 13:06.957
-not the Dreamlord itself.
-[gasps]

13:07.047 --> 13:08.627
They're only
the creature's minions.

13:10.007 --> 13:13.007
But soon, it will be here.

13:13.717 --> 13:14.797
[gasps]

13:23.187 --> 13:24.147
[Ruche gasps]

13:29.237 --> 13:31.067
No way. [whimpers]

13:31.147 --> 13:34.117
Now he's up against
three Level 40s?

13:35.777 --> 13:37.947
[ELYMAS] I'll be right
behind you, just as soon as

13:38.037 --> 13:39.327
-I've bought some time.
-You can't!

13:39.407 --> 13:41.037
And it wouldn't be right
for me to run off

13:41.117 --> 13:43.037
and let you fight them
all by yourself!

13:43.117 --> 13:44.997
Not after you invited me
to join your party.

13:45.077 --> 13:47.497
Do you really want me
to spell it out for you?!

13:47.587 --> 13:50.507
I can't carry dead weight
while I'm fighting these guys.

13:50.587 --> 13:52.217
You'd just get in the way.

13:53.427 --> 13:54.547
Understand?

13:54.637 --> 13:56.007
[gasps]

13:57.217 --> 13:58.637
[whimpers]

14:04.637 --> 14:06.977
Yeah. You're right.

14:08.227 --> 14:09.317
I'm sorry.

14:12.897 --> 14:14.987
[Elymas grunts]

14:15.817 --> 14:18.367
Well, just don't take too long,
Mr. Elymas.

14:19.447 --> 14:20.447
[grunts]

14:22.077 --> 14:23.707
[ELYMAS] Three Level 40s, huh?

14:25.537 --> 14:26.457
[grunts]

14:29.127 --> 14:33.167
If Ruche had stayed back here,
and we'd battled them together,

14:33.257 --> 14:35.467
the two of us might have
been able to defeat them.

14:39.297 --> 14:40.347
[grunts]

14:40.427 --> 14:41.467
But...

14:42.727 --> 14:44.517
[baby crying]

14:45.387 --> 14:47.107
The Dreamlord
is still out there.

14:48.107 --> 14:50.267
I told her
I would draw them to me

14:50.357 --> 14:52.187
and then run
when I got the chance,

14:52.277 --> 14:53.527
but that was a lie.

14:54.567 --> 14:57.527
As a Heavy Knight,
I don't have any speed.

14:58.277 --> 15:00.777
I might be able
to escape a few Tin Knights.

15:00.867 --> 15:03.077
But trying to run
from a dungeon boss

15:03.157 --> 15:04.827
who's using magic attacks?

15:04.907 --> 15:06.247
[baby crying]

15:07.247 --> 15:08.327
That's impossible.

15:12.207 --> 15:14.917
[snarling]

15:19.597 --> 15:22.637
I'll have to defeat
this Dreamlord right here.

15:24.477 --> 15:27.187
There you are, Dreamlord Embryo!

15:27.267 --> 15:28.977
[Embryo crying]

15:34.397 --> 15:36.237
[ELYMAS] For a Level 50 monster,

15:36.317 --> 15:38.067
the Embryo's stats
are fairly low.

15:38.777 --> 15:42.157
The problem is, I won't be able
to deal damage to it.

15:42.867 --> 15:44.747
Its flesh's Defense
is far too high

15:44.827 --> 15:46.407
for my attacks to get through.

15:47.077 --> 15:49.077
Only its eye
is truly vulnerable.

15:51.207 --> 15:52.997
And it's not an easy target.

15:53.667 --> 15:55.547
Reaching it requires
ranged attacks.

15:56.757 --> 15:59.967
But if it's got a weakness,

16:00.047 --> 16:03.887
then even a low-level adventurer
can take it down.

16:05.057 --> 16:06.307
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Oath of the Heavy Armor

16:06.387 --> 16:07.977
has reached Level 27.

16:08.057 --> 16:11.437
New skill acquired. Shield Bash.

16:12.767 --> 16:15.187
It's your move, Embryo!

16:16.277 --> 16:17.737
I won't run!

16:17.817 --> 16:20.197
I'm ready to battle you head-on!

16:24.697 --> 16:28.367
Shield Bash!

16:33.747 --> 16:35.457
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Skill, Shield Bash.

16:36.087 --> 16:38.757
Push an enemy with a shield
and knock them back.

16:41.757 --> 16:42.887
[ELYMAS]
Good thing I have a skill

16:42.967 --> 16:44.547
that lets me split up
my enemies.

16:47.477 --> 16:48.387
Parry!

16:48.477 --> 16:50.307
[grunts] Disarm!

16:52.937 --> 16:55.357
The Embryo has
two magic attacks,

16:55.437 --> 16:57.817
Sylph Cutter and Thunderstorm.

16:57.897 --> 16:59.187
But it won't use either

16:59.277 --> 17:00.777
if the Tin Knights
are in their path.

17:01.907 --> 17:04.987
Which means
I can focus on these three!

17:05.077 --> 17:06.037
[grunts]

17:06.657 --> 17:09.697
[panting, grunting]

17:10.207 --> 17:12.247
[grunts] Disarm!

17:13.167 --> 17:14.877
That's the second hit.

17:14.957 --> 17:18.337
It's only been 47 seconds
since the first Disarm.

17:18.417 --> 17:20.837
[♪ dramatic music playing]

17:20.917 --> 17:22.837
I've met
the activation conditions.

17:25.467 --> 17:26.557
[grunts]

17:28.597 --> 17:30.597
Rampart Reflection!

17:31.477 --> 17:34.017
Rampart Reflection!

17:34.107 --> 17:36.107
The real battle starts now.

17:38.107 --> 17:39.607
That's one down.

17:43.407 --> 17:44.777
Still.

17:44.867 --> 17:46.117
[Embryo babbles]

17:49.197 --> 17:50.447
[gasps]

18:08.807 --> 18:10.927
If I'm not able
to defeat the Embryo,

18:11.017 --> 18:13.227
the Tin Knights will just
keep getting revived.

18:13.307 --> 18:14.347
[Embryo babbles happily]

18:15.017 --> 18:18.397
But I've noticed
each time it uses its magic,

18:18.477 --> 18:20.437
its eye is completely exposed.

18:21.937 --> 18:23.947
[grunts]

18:24.027 --> 18:26.657
Take this!

18:30.037 --> 18:31.447
[cries in pain]

18:31.537 --> 18:32.697
[ELYMAS] It's the one attack
I've got

18:32.787 --> 18:33.997
that can actually reach it.

18:34.617 --> 18:36.377
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Earth Magic Stone.

18:37.497 --> 18:40.547
Spend MP to fire
countless needles of earth.

18:40.627 --> 18:43.207
[crying]

18:43.297 --> 18:44.667
[ELYMAS] I can use
the Tin Knight as a shield

18:44.757 --> 18:47.547
to protect myself against
its Sylph Cutter attack.

18:47.637 --> 18:48.967
As long as
I don't screw this up,

18:49.507 --> 18:51.717
I'll be able to keep myself
from getting one-shotted.

18:54.727 --> 18:56.057
[grunts]

18:56.137 --> 18:57.437
Shield Bash!

19:00.227 --> 19:01.777
What?

19:01.857 --> 19:03.107
[gasps]

19:04.317 --> 19:06.107
[grunts] Final Slash!

19:10.947 --> 19:13.327
Somehow,
they're beginning to learn.

19:15.207 --> 19:17.627
Monsters could never adapt
to the skills players used

19:17.707 --> 19:19.037
against them in Magic World.

19:21.667 --> 19:23.547
Fighting these three,

19:23.627 --> 19:26.377
it's clear they can recognize
when Shield Bash is coming.

19:29.757 --> 19:31.637
I should have expected this.

19:32.807 --> 19:34.807
It'll make destroying
the Embryo even harder

19:34.887 --> 19:36.267
than I first anticipated.

19:36.937 --> 19:39.647
The only possible way
I'll be able to beat it

19:39.727 --> 19:42.147
is to throw
three more Magic Stones,

19:42.227 --> 19:44.147
but Dreamlords
regenerate very quickly.

19:45.107 --> 19:47.647
If I take too long, I'm screwed.

19:47.737 --> 19:48.697
[gasps]

19:50.777 --> 19:51.987
[Embryo laughs]

19:52.077 --> 19:53.537
[ELYMAS] No way.

19:53.617 --> 19:56.287
It shouldn't use Sylph Cutter
with us positioned like this!

20:00.037 --> 20:01.417
[gasps]

20:02.707 --> 20:04.207
It's no use.

20:04.297 --> 20:06.087
I can't dodge it!

20:10.797 --> 20:13.347
[yelling]

20:16.467 --> 20:18.057
[screams]

20:20.897 --> 20:22.477
[grunting]

20:23.437 --> 20:24.527
[grunts]

20:33.367 --> 20:35.287
[Embryo laughing]

20:35.367 --> 20:38.117
[Elymas grunts]
I'm losing consciousness.

20:38.197 --> 20:40.287
[breathing laboriously]

20:40.367 --> 20:41.877
-[heart thumping]
-My heart

20:41.957 --> 20:43.627
is pounding out of my chest.

20:45.167 --> 20:47.627
And I can feel my legs
growing weaker.

20:47.707 --> 20:49.257
[heart thumping]

20:52.797 --> 20:54.847
[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Status effect, Stunned.

20:57.467 --> 20:58.387
[ELYMAS] I see.

20:59.347 --> 21:02.307
In a situation like this,
a stun is fatal.

21:02.397 --> 21:03.687
[straining]

21:03.767 --> 21:04.767
Who knows?

21:05.607 --> 21:08.487
Maybe my starting Luck value
was set too low.

21:12.407 --> 21:15.697
Well, Ruche,
I should have asked you to stay.

21:16.407 --> 21:18.287
Come on.
Let's defeat it together!

21:28.547 --> 21:30.047
[RUCHE] Did ya call for me?

21:30.127 --> 21:32.047
[♪ dramatic music playing]

21:32.127 --> 21:33.507
[straining]

21:34.427 --> 21:35.597
[gasps]

21:35.677 --> 21:37.887
Thanks for asking me
to join your party.

21:40.887 --> 21:42.887
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:10.567 --> 23:12.567
[ELYMAS] I wasn't overconfident.

23:12.647 --> 23:14.237
I gave everything
I possibly could

23:14.317 --> 23:15.607
to that fight.

23:15.697 --> 23:17.567
But no matter what I tried,

23:17.657 --> 23:18.867
I still wasn't able

23:18.947 --> 23:20.697
to take down
the Dreamlord Embryo.

23:20.777 --> 23:23.077
Then Ruche rescued me,

23:23.157 --> 23:26.367
putting herself in danger
to make sure I was safe.

23:26.457 --> 23:31.667
So now I-- No, we are going
to defeat the Embryo together

23:31.747 --> 23:33.497
and beat this dungeon.

23:33.587 --> 23:35.917
Next time, "Dreamlord."

23:36.667 --> 23:39.087
Ruche is far more
than I ever could have imagined.
